***********************************************
****sky130A transistor models for ltspice****
***********************************************
*Minor changes to model definitions to make it work
*Import xnch.asy and xpch.asy symbols
*Change the subcircuit definition to the desired transistor
*
* To use add the following libraries to Ltspice
*.lib "sky130A_ltspice.lib" <Corner>
*
*If you are using MacOS ltspice does not recognize the paths correctly
*Use this instead
*.lib "sky130A_ltspice_<Corner>.lib"
*
*Corner can be: tt, ss, ff, sf, fs
*
*Make sure you have "./sky130A_ltspice" directory inside your working directory
*
*Monte Carlo Simulations currently not working.
*It requires major changes to the models to make it work
************************************************
*Modified by Adan Torralba
*
* 2026/08/11 Initial Release
*
***********************************************
*Transistor definitions with perimeter and area calculations

